<!-- 02 · ABOUT -->
<section class="rec" id="about" data-title="About" data-fx="up" aria-labelledby="t-about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="rh rv"><span class="rn" aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><h2 class="rt" id="t-about" data-split>About me</h2><p class="rsub">Learning, building, and growing in IT.</p></div></header>
    <div class="about-g">
      <figure class="about-ph rv" data-r="clip"><img src="images/casual-1.jpg" alt="Jena Benisse Redondo smiling in a casual portrait" loading="lazy" width="900" height="1004" data-zoom="Jena Benisse Redondo — casual portrait"><figcaption><b>Jena Benisse Redondo</b><span>BSIT · La Consolacion College Tanauan</span></figcaption></figure>
      <div class="about-t">
        <h3 class="sub">A little about myself</h3>
        <p class="big rv">Hello! I am <strong>Jena Benisse Redondo</strong>, currently taking Bachelor of Science in Information Technology at La Consolacion College Tanauan. A motivated and detail-oriented individual with a strong interest in technology and developing practical solutions.</p>
        <div class="cols rv" id="bio">
          <p>I am interested in web development, user interface design, database management, system development, and computer networking. I enjoy learning technologies that allow me to build practical and user-friendly solutions.</p>
          <p>Through my academic projects, I have gained experience with <strong>HTML, CSS, JavaScript, PHP, MySQL, and CRUD-based systems.</strong> I have also completed networking courses covering network communication, addressing, device configuration, troubleshooting, and network support.</p>
          <p>I also had the opportunity to attend a robotics workshop, which allowed me to explore robotics and technology beyond regular web and database development. I am still continuing to learn and explore this area as part of my growth as an IT student.</p>
          <p>My goal is to continuously improve my technical skills, gain more hands-on experience, and create digital solutions that are useful, reliable, and easy to understand — while contributing positively to a professional work environment.</p>
        </div>
        <button class="more" id="bioMore" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="bio"><span>Read the full story</span><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i></button>
        <ul class="traits rv" aria-label="Strengths"><li>Communication</li><li>Teamwork</li><li>Problem-Solving</li><li>Time Management</li><li>Adaptability</li><li>Attention to Detail</li></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-b">
      <ul class="mot rv" aria-label="How I learn">
        <li tabindex="0"><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i><b>Curious Learner</b><span>Always exploring new technologies</span></li>
        <li tabindex="0"><i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code"></i><b>Hands-on Builder</b><span>Learning through real projects</span></li>
        <li tabindex="0"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i><b>Continuous Growth</b><span>Improving one skill at a time</span></li>
      </ul>
      <article class="file rv" data-r="left"><span class="hole" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="ic"><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i></div><h3>Current education</h3><p><b>Bachelor of Science in Information Technology</b> — La Consolacion College Tanauan (2024 – Present). Academic learning focused on programming, web development, databases, networking, system development, and practical technology applications.</p><ul class="chips"><li><i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i> Programming</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-database"></i> Databases</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired"></i> Networking</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-window-maximize"></i> Web Development</li></ul></article>
    </div>
    <div class="dos rv">
      <div class="term"><div class="term-h"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>jena@portfolio:~</span><div class="tt" role="tablist"><button class="on" data-p="tp" role="tab" aria-selected="true">terminal</button><button data-p="tj" role="tab" aria-selected="false">jena.js</button></div></div><pre id="tp" aria-label="About Jena in terminal style"></pre><pre id="tj" hidden aria-label="Code summary of Jena"></pre></div>
      <div class="now"><h3 class="sub">Right now</h3><ul><li><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i><span><b>Studying</b>3rd Year, 1st Semester — BSIT</span></li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i><span><b>Building</b>Web systems &amp; database apps</span></li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired"></i><span><b>Exploring</b>Networking &amp; robotics</span></li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i><span><b>Based in</b>Tanauan City, Batangas</span></li></ul></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

