<!-- 05 · SKILLS -->
<section class="rec" id="skills" data-title="Skills" data-fx="up" aria-labelledby="t-skills">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="rh rv"><span class="rn" aria-hidden="true">05</span><div><h2 class="rt" id="t-skills" data-split>My skills</h2><p class="rsub">Core technology stack — select a cluster or a node to explore.</p></div></header>
    <div class="sk-g rv">
      <div class="sk-stage" id="skStage" role="group" aria-label="Interactive skills constellation"><svg id="skLines" aria-hidden="true" preserveAspectRatio="none"></svg></div>
      <aside class="sk-info" aria-live="polite"><p class="cat" id="skCat">Cluster · All</p><h3 id="skName">Pick a node</h3><p id="skDesc">Select any skill in the constellation to read how I use it. Use the clusters to filter.</p><div class="tabs" id="stabs"></div><h4 class="sk-u">Tech universe</h4><ul class="chips" id="skU"></ul></aside>
    </div>
    <p class="note rv"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i><span>My skills continue to develop through academic projects, hands-on practice, certifications, and continuous exploration of technology.</span></p>
    <div class="grow">
      <div class="grow-l rv"><h3>Currently learning &amp; growing</h3><p>I believe that becoming better in technology comes from continuously learning, building, testing, and improving.</p><p>My current focus is strengthening the skills I already use while gaining more practical experience through projects, academic work, and hands-on exploration.</p></div>
